From 9cabcfabb6173453ef23221fd8cc0cab446371bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:21:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libtaskmanager: Allow filtering tasks from other desktops and
 screens

The filters could only keep tasks on the current virtual desktop, screen
or activity. They now take a mode (all, current or other), so a second
task manager can list only the windows that are somewhere else.

BUG: 450545
